      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bejou%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Bejou sits entirely inside the White Earth Indian Reservation, covering all of Mahnomen County and parts of neighboring counties.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
